# Kubernetes secrets.
# I-1 FIX: the previous pattern `deployment/kubernetes/secrets.yaml` was anchored
# to the repo root and did NOT match the real path
# `infra/deployment/kubernetes/secrets.yaml`. Use a `**/` glob so any depth is
# ignored. NOTE: infra/deployment/kubernetes/secrets.yaml is intentionally tracked
# as a placeholder-only template (all values are base64 "CHANGEME"); .gitignore
# does not affect already-tracked files. This rule prevents a *populated* copy
# (real secrets) from ever being added at this path.
**/deployment/kubernetes/secrets.yaml

.fuse_hidden*

